title: Analytics › Common denial reasons: open Denial Intelligence
route: /analytics
intro: The table of common denial reasons sits in a folded section under 'Detailed breakdowns'. Every row is a link to Denial Intelligence, by the row or by the reason text. The link carries the row's payer and its reason, so the denial list opens already narrowed to those denials.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Under 'Detailed breakdowns', click 'Common denial reasons by payer'\nOr Tab to it and press Enter or Space"
screen sc "Section opens\nSummary stays: '311 denials this quarter. Most common: ...'\n'This quarter. Each payer's most common reason. Select a row to open those denials in Denial Intelligence.'\nWith a program picked: 'This quarter · IOP.'"
screen th "Columns\n'Reason', 'Payer', 'Count', 'Share of denials' (a red bar and the percent)"

decision q1 "Which payer is chosen in the menu?"
process p1 "'All payers': one row per payer, its most common reason\nBiggest first\nShare is of all the denials in view, so the rows add up to less than 100%"
screen r1 "Cardinal 73 · 23%\n'Continued-stay evidence incomplete'"
screen r2 "Evergreen 34 · 11%\n'Partial approval without a stated reason'"
screen r3 "Summit Medicaid 28 · 9%\n'Level of care does not match mood severity'"
screen r4 "Harborview MA 15 · 5%\nBeacon PPO 13 · 4%"
process p2 "A payer with fewer than 20 denials is left out\nLakeshore this quarter and last quarter"
process p3 "One payer: all of that payer's reasons, three or four rows\nShares add up to 100% of that payer's denials\nEvery count is part of the denials behind the 'Denial rate' tile"
decision q2 "Fewer than 20 denials in view?"
screen nd "'Not enough decisions yet. Figures based on fewer than 20 decisions stay hidden.'\nNo table, no link"

group gClick "Open a row"
  click c1 "Click anywhere on a row"
  click c2 "Click the reason text, for example 'Recertification filed too late'"
  process p4 "Opens /denials?payer=harborview&reason=Recertification filed too late\nThe row's own payer and reason go along (spaces become plus signs)\nRow hover tint shows it is a link"
endgroup

goto g1 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Open denials list"
process p5 "Browser Back returns to Analytics with the menus reset"

s1 --> sc --> th --> q1
q1 -->|All payers| p1
p1 --> r1 & r2 & r3 & r4
p1 -.-> p2
q1 -->|One payer| p3
p3 --> q2
p2 --> q2
q2 -->|Yes| nd
q2 -->|No| c1 & c2
r1 & r2 & r3 & r4 --> c1 & c2
c1 --> p4
c2 --> p4
p4 --> g1
g1 -.-> p5
